  "notable_quotes": [
    "The nonmonotonic transport trend in Na-SSZ-39 is attributed to AEI cage geometry and is presented as experimental evidence of window effects.",
    "Measured transport properties are linked to apparent diffusion coefficients, as indicated by pellet-size and carrier-gas variation experiments.",
    "Inverse gas chromatography on Na-SSZ-39 shows transport properties of C5-C10 n-alkanes vary nonmonotonically with chain length and peak at n-octane."
